{
  "name": "dsh-coke",
  "version": "0.9.0",
  "description": "小猫coke：会待在桌面上的猫桌宠。左键点它按权重抽 7 句台词并 Q 弹蹦一下；右键能「对话」（像 dsh-pet 那样在头顶弹输入框，回答用当前模型生成、可选配一张表情包）、「唱歌」、「形态展示」、「自定义装扮」、「枪击小猫」；脚下按钮查 DeepSeek 余额；设置页可切桌面窗口 / 页面内 / 关闭、卸载；默认随 DSH 自动启动。",
  "icon": "assets/logo.png",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "assets",
    "runtime",
    "scripts",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE",
    "package.json"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "desktop-pet",
    "pet",
    "meme",
    "balance",
    "singing",
    "electron",
    "coke"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [],
      "platform": "web"
    },
    "compatibility": {
      "dshReleases": {
        "0.1.7-rc.2": "incompatible",
        "0.2.0-rc.1": "compatible",
        "0.2.0-rc.2": "compatible"
      }
    }
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=22.12.0"
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "scripts": {
    "pack": "node scripts/pack.mjs",
    "publish:npm": "node scripts/publish.mjs"
  }
}
